    festTitre: 'French Riviera festivals: summer in Nice, Cannes, Monaco · Teufy', festDesc: 'French Riviera festivals: upcoming dates and a guide to the summer festivals (Nice Jazz Festival, Jazz à Juan, Nuits du Sud…) and the big events of the year.', festH1: '<em>Festivals</em> on the French Riviera', festP: 'Upcoming festivals in the guide, plus the summer festivals and the big events of the year on the coast.', festAgendaH2: 'Coming up in the <em>guide</em>', festAgendaVide: 'No festival in the guide for the coming weeks: they come back with the sunny days.', festGuideH2: '<em>Summer</em> festivals', festRdvH2: 'Big events of the <em>year</em>', festAvert: 'Dates change every year: they are added to the guide as soon as they are official. Always check the official website.', siteOfficiel: 'Official website',
